1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Quickly now. The final placement.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Anywhere... please, just don't leave me.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,800
Even mercy recoiled.

4
00:00:18,093 --> 00:00:21,093
No... NO! Mountains of ash! I see fire!

5
00:00:21,093 --> 00:00:24,093
What? Which house?

6
00:00:24,093 --> 00:00:27,093
NONE! She is the end of us all!

7
00:00:27,093 --> 00:00:29,343
She heard.

8
00:00:30,162 --> 00:00:32,912
Mercy withdrew.

9
00:00:34,162 --> 00:00:37,662
Wait! I can be good! I promise!

10
00:00:37,662 --> 00:00:40,662
Forgive me, child...

11
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:43,162
...I cannot save a monster.

12
00:00:43,162 --> 00:00:44,612
Alone.

13
00:00:45,231 --> 00:00:50,031
What was refused in love hardened into law.

14
00:00:56,231 --> 00:01:00,231
...Then I will build my own house.
